  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0136_11904da4056c.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 233px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p>Vertical velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><br />&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>increase</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>decrease</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>decrease.</p>"
